description: New features must prefer Jetpack Compose (Material3) over XML/View UI
alwaysApply: true
---

# Compose-first UI

- New feature UI must use **Jetpack Compose + Material3** under `easycontrolnext/app/src/main/java/com/shiyunjin/easycontrolnext/app/ui/`.
- Do **not** add new XML layouts or View-based `Activity` screens for new feature UI.
- Reuse existing Compose patterns in `ui/` (e.g. `DeviceEditorScreen`, `DeviceConfigForm`, `ui/theme`).
- **Exception**: existing WindowManager floating views (`SmallView` / `MiniView`) may remain View-based until migrated; do not migrate them unless asked.
